# European Portuguese translation of LlamaFit.
# This file is distributed under the same licence as LlamaFit.
#
# NOT YET REVIEWED BY A NATIVE SPEAKER. It was written alongside the machinery that
# reads it, and grew with the sweep that wrapped LlamaFit's messages, and it has had no
# second reader. By the standard docs/translations.md sets for every language, that is
